ngth to Luck, each stat plays a vital role in shaping how you handle different enemies and bosses.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/6e8549dcac493feca42fafae916ae079.poster.avif?t=1771052758\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/6e8549dcac493feca42fafae916ae079.webm?t=1771052758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/6e8549dcac493feca42fafae916ae079.mp4?t=1771052758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/08f35d9baf91e373738e6a87a042604b.avif?t=1771052758\" width=342 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many skills with different usage</strong>, the hand\u2019s potential is limitless. Upgrade a variety of abilities, from flashy attacks to clever evasions, and mix and match them to suit your strategy. Whether you\u2019re focusing on brutal damage or tactical control, the flexibility in skill combinations ensures that every playthrough is fantastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/eaf02ea92bea3d55f3b0d96c52b11ae5.poster.avif?t=1771052758\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/eaf02ea92bea3d55f3b0d96c52b11ae5.webm?t=1771052758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264850/extras/eaf02ea92bea3d55f3b0d96c52b11ae5.mp4?t=1771052758\" type=\"video/mp4\